        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Madamnyeanda sabiibu bea Naboti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Naboteeda was siida ng'eanyiida Yesneli gwandeawa madamnyeanda sabiibu aba Yesneli, aba murdeeda gheeda Ahabu was sugoocheanda Samariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata gwayeesha Ahabu Naboti, “Goonean madamnyeandaang'u bea sabiibu, ak ghaanung' ghoah shiidaneedeanyu bea nyeanyiida, aba gideaba ea neekeewa gheanyu; ak abeeda gaydagoonyi madamnyeanda nuut miy bea sabiibu; ghana iibwariinyi, gaydagoonyi lapiyeeda deaschi mooneadaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Naboti Ahabu, “Ghaheawa NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba gaydagoonyi haleanjeeda hearaniischooda aba heeda ghweanigeasu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabiikta Ahabu gheanyi nea gagiisan nea ghwanyareas aba gida rukusa Naboteeda ng'eanyiida Yesneli; aba gideaba gwayeesha, “Maydagoonyi hearana heeda ghweanigeasu.” Ng'ata gawiil geaw aba badayda bulaliidaanyi ak ghwasach uhuuda nea ghaheawa gweagiischi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu headaanyi gatmoadaanyi was Yesebeli, ak gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan inyas guwoosi nyareasaat aba gurooroadaang'u ea raanya agiischooda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha gatmooda, “Aba gideaba geabalooli Naboteeda was siida ng'eanyiida Yesneli, nea geayeeshi, ‘Goonean madamnyeandaang'u bea sabiibu aba lapiya, ghana aba gil nuut, inyas gaybwariinya gaydagoonyi madamnyeanda nuut bea sabiibu’; hean gwayi niny, ‘Maydagoonyi madamnyeandeanyu bea sabiibu.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha gatmoadaanyi was Yesebeli, “Ang'iing'i miihaaghwani Israeli? Ng'eada, ak giyaagi mukaate, ak ginung' gahoosan gurooroadaang'u; gaydanyakneey madamnyeanda sabiibu bea Naboteeda ng'eanyiida Yesneli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'oar barawajeanda aba gheawunga Ahabu ak ghang'uda mooneadaanyi, ak goojeakta barawajeega heeda gweargwa ea heeda fuga mideaydooschi Naboti aba jeeda mujiineeda haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gang'oorsa jeeda barawajeega gideaba, “Ooluulda geat, ak ghoayiinyi Naboti heetiyeada aba madeeda buuneeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghoamiindi fih iyeenya mideawa badeeda ak ghoanung' ghoahaakta niny, nea gwayi, ‘Nimwaashti ASEETA ea sugoocheanda.’ Ak gooruuti, ak goofuti lagheanga ea ghami.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak headiga mujiineadaanyi haw, gweargwa ea fuga hees abiita jeeda mujiineadaanyi haw, gwasinda ng'asheanda gida ajeakteayda Yesebeli. Gawuurji gissing'oarda aba jeeda barawajeega ghayi ng'oorsa saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geerugu giiluuldeaydeaba geat, ak geayiin Naboti madeeda buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghapka headaanyi fih iyeenya mideawa badeeda ak goobiitpiit aba madeadaanyi; ak ghoahaakta fugiga bea badeedean Naboti, aba madeeda buuneeda, nea gwayeesha, “Naboti nimwaashta ASEETA ea sugoocheanda.” Hean geeruuteawa jeeda mujiineeda haw, ak geefuta lagheanga ea ghami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu geecheaksa Yesebeli, nea geeyeesha, “Naboti sifuta lagheanga; ak ghamneawa ea nimi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwayiiy Yesebeli gideaba Naboti sifuta lagheanga ea ghami, ak gwayeesha Yesebeli Ahabu, “Ng'eada, geanda madamnyeanda sabiibu bea Naboteeda ng'eanyiida Yeseneli, ghayi heawa gagoonyi aba lapiya, aba gideaba Naboti mudu gwandeawa eaweega, goola ghami.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayiiy Ahabu gideaba Naboti goola ghami, ghang'eat Ahabu ak gwahiing'eesa madamnyeanda sabiibu bea Naboteeda ng'eanyiida Yeseneli, ak goombal ghoah daanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Eliyaheeda ng'eanyiida Dishbi, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'eada hiing'aada una roonyeewana Ahabuheeda was sugoocheanda Israeli, nea gwanda Samariya; ng'ula gwanda jeeda madamnyeanda sabiibu bea Naboti, weah gwahearan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giyeeshi, ‘Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, “ghamneawa nireang'u, nea nihearaniischi?”’ Ak gajeeshiina, ‘Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA: “Heeda meeshsa gudajeega foojeanda Naboti, gaygameeriisa gudajeega hoowa foojeandaang'u”’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Ahabu Eliya, “Ninyaschaan, Ea weajoocheandeanyu?” Hean gwayeesha Eliya, “Naanyascheey, aba gideaba nishaaydi geaw aba heeda siida muy aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, gaydajagu munyinda headaang'u; ak gaydahuuydaneey, ak gaydahuta gilinyoo ea ng'eedeeda gil bea gheeh Ahabu, dea mida ghealooniga ghana dea abal geaw bea Israeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydanung' gawuurji gheang'u sea gheeh Yeroboamooda was orjeeda Nebati, ea gheeda Baashaheeda was orjeeda Ahiya, aba nyarasta nung' danyareas, ea gideaba ginung' gwasin riing'eeda fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda Yesebeli, ‘Gayghwaak Yesebeli gudajeega aba mooheeda Yesreeli.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilinyoo gaba gheeh Ahabu iimeewsa jeeda mujiineeda haw gayghwaak gudajeega; nea siida nyooh gameewsa mooheeda gayghwaak mustaanyi madoonyaka humng'eeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Nea ea manda siida shaayda geaw ak gwasin munyinda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA jea eegala Ahabu, nea abeeda ghwasap gatmoadaanyi siguura Yesebeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasin gidamuy aba badooda sanaamu, gawuurji gida sin fuga Amori, ghayi hoana NG'UTAMIIDA madeeda fuga Israeli.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayiiy Ahabu ng'asheesu, ak ghabwaashaada hang'weakaaschi, ak gookwa guniyajeega, ng'ata gooluulda geaw ak gawiil geaw aba badayda guniyajeega ak goojiileadayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:28"
          },
